 the individual will arrive at the global optima. I think it's difficult to say what that even might be or how individuals might get to such a place at all. But I think it is likely that the individual will be more likely to find a more global optima and more easily move from one optimal to another. And I think that's kind of what this openness is corresponding to. Yeah. Okay.", 'words': [{'text': 'Yeah.', 'start': 5364940, 'end': 5365304, 'confidence': 0.99988, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'So', 'start': 5365342, 'end': 5365930, 'confidence': 0.60727, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'as', 'start': 5366300, 'end': 5366664, 'confidence': 0.5246, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'I', 'start': 5366702, 'end': 5366808, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'think', 'start': 5366814, 'end': 5366936, 'confidence': 0.99998, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'I', 'start': 5366958, 'end': 5367096, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'understand', 'start': 5367118, 'end': 5367412, 'confidence': 0.99999, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'the', 'start': 5367486, 'end': 5367676, 'confidence': 0.97, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'question,', 'start': 5367698, 'end': 5367884, 'confidence': 0.99992, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'right,', 'start': 5367922, 'end': 5368124, 'confidence': 0.92909, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': "it's", 'start': 5368162, 'end': 5368456, 'confidence': 0.56639, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'basically', 'start': 5368488, 'end': 5368780, 'confidence': 0.99998, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'asking', 'start': 5368850, 'end': 5369132, 'confidence': 0.99997, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'about', 'start': 5369186, 'end': 5369548, 'confidence': 0.8832, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'trying', 'start': 5369634, 'end': 5369836, 'confidence': 0.99999, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'to', 'start': 5369858, 'end': 5370044, 'confidence': 0.71, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'optimize', 'start': 5370082, 'end': 5370776, 'confidence': 0.89787, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'for', 'start': 5370888, 'end': 5371548, 'confidence