, which then are suppressing the ascending stream of prediction errors. And so under revis, you're seeing here relaxed predictions, a smaller complex of synchronized activity. And the gates are down. Just like Arthur described, more things are coming in.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.018741890788078308, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>ArtificialIntelligence'}, {'relevance': 0.008164982311427593, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>DiseasesAndConditions>BrainAndNervousSystemDisorders'}, {'relevance': 0.00584592716768384, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>DiseasesAndConditions>EyeAndVisionConditions'}, {'relevance': 0.00404922291636467, 'label': 'Religion&Spirituality>Astrology'}, {'relevance': 0.002404627623036504, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>DiseasesAndConditions>SleepDisorders'}, {'relevance': 0.0022133653983473778, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>ParanormalPhenomena'}, {'relevance': 0.0013749846257269382, 'label': 'Science'}, {'relevance': 0.0013369399821385741, 'label': 'Science>SpaceAndAstronomy'}, {'relevance': 0.0008527587633579969, 'label': 'Science>Physics'}, {'relevance': 0.0007227540481835604, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>MedicalTests'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 1881006, 'end': 1922954}, 'sentences_idx_start': 163, 'sentences_idx_end': 167}, {'text': "Rebus will sometimes be described in terms of so when we're talking about rebus this idea of relaxing beliefs. We're thinking at the functional or computational level, like with David Mars and analyzing the mind, you have these three, I suppose, Supervenient levels. They're compatible and synergistic. So computational functional, like abstractly, what is the system doing? Something like the pseudocode of the system and then implementational mechanistically how it's realized and then in the middle, some sort of algorithmic intermediate abstraction layer.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.9186733961105347, 'label': 'Religion&Spirituality>Spirituality'}, {'relevance': 0.28031471371650696, 'label': 'Religion&Spirituality'}, {'relevance': 0.072496533393859