oned this idea of set and setting, right. As being heavily predictive of the quality of the acute psychedelic experience, and often also, to some extent, the quality of the post acute experience. And I think we can understand this in the deep canals model, quite straightforwardly.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.07280798256397247, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>DiseasesAndConditions>SubstanceAbuse'}, {'relevance': 0.022689418867230415, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>ParanormalPhenomena'}, {'relevance': 0.015231332741677761, 'label': 'HealthyLiving>Wellness>AlternativeMedicine>HolisticHealth'}, {'relevance': 0.013610608875751495, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>DiseasesAndConditions>SleepDisorders'}, {'relevance': 0.008568564429879189, 'label': 'Religion&Spirituality>Spirituality'}, {'relevance': 0.0059538111090660095, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>DiseasesAndConditions>BrainAndNervousSystemDisorders'}, {'relevance': 0.005391472019255161, 'label': 'HealthyLiving>Wellness>AlternativeMedicine'}, {'relevance': 0.0050522214733064175, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>DiseasesAndConditions>MentalHealth'}, {'relevance': 0.0021570073440670967, 'label': 'Religion&Spirituality'}, {'relevance': 0.0008110718335956335, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>MedicalTests'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 4674360, 'end': 4701580}, 'sentences_idx_start': 446, 'sentences_idx_end': 448}, {'text': "So I'll just quickly pull back up one of these slides here. Yeah. Right. So what is set and setting? So set is mindset, which would basically be some combination of your current position in the synaptic weight landscape and the current state of your neural activation landscape. Right. So your place in both landscapes is your mindset, and the setting is what is generating this input. Right. What is generating the x into the network. And that's some complicated function of the environment.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.06423991918563843, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>DiseasesAndConditions>BrainAndNervousSystemDisorders'}, {'relevance': 0.031105732545256615,