, how one deploys attention essentially during this experience. And I think this deployment of attention has a huge effect on whether there end up being rebus or CBIS like effects. Right? So whether one allows oneself to go down certain thought rabbit holes, whether one allows oneself to get kind of stuck in certain kinds of thought patterns.", 'start': 5926800, 'end': 5975260, 'confidence': 1.0, 'words': [{'text': 'And', 'start': 5926800, 'end': 5927116, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'I', 'start': 5927138, 'end': 5927276, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'think', 'start': 5927298, 'end': 5927870, 'confidence': 0.99834, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': "it's", 'start': 5928720, 'end': 5929128, 'confidence': 0.9957, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'already', 'start': 5929144, 'end': 5929372, 'confidence': 0.99993, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'clear', 'start': 5929426, 'end': 5929644, 'confidence': 0.99999, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'that', 'start': 5929682, 'end': 5930316, 'confidence': 0.99998, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': "there's", 'start': 5930498, 'end': 5930968, 'confidence': 0.55088, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'a', 'start': 5930984, 'end': 5931116, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'kind', 'start': 5931138, 'end': 5931228, 'confidence': 0.99975, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'of', 'start': 5931234, 'end': 5931404, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'whole', 'start': 5931442, 'end': 5932030, 'confidence': 0.99905, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'set', 'start': 5933200, 'end': 5933564, 'confidence': 0.83068, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'of', 'start': 5933602, 'end': 5933804, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'folk', 'start': 5933842, 'end': 5934136, 'confidence': 0.69829, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'psychology', 'start': 5934168, 'end': 5934776, 'confidence': 0.99487, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': "that's", 'start': 5934888, 'end': 5935128, 'confidence': 0.99994, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'been', 'start': 5935144, 'end': 5935276, 'confide